<Window x:Class="ClipboardTool.HelpWindow"
        xmlns="http://schemas.microsoft.com/winfx/2006/xaml/presentation"
        xmlns:x="http://schemas.microsoft.com/winfx/2006/xaml"
        Title="使用说明 — 剪贴板工具"
        Width="580" Height="480"
        WindowStartupLocation="CenterOwner"
        Background="#F3F3F3">
    <Grid Margin="16">
        <TabControl FontSize="13" Background="Transparent" BorderThickness="0">
            <!-- 功能概览 -->
            <TabItem Header="功能概览" Padding="8,4">
                <ScrollViewer VerticalScrollBarVisibility="Auto" Padding="12">
                    <StackPanel Margin="4">
                        <TextBlock Text="剪贴板工具 — 功能概览" FontSize="18" FontWeight="SemiBold" Foreground="#1A1A1A" Margin="0,0,0,12"/>
                        <TextBlock TextWrapping="Wrap" Foreground="#444" LineHeight="24" Margin="0,0,0,8">
                            本工具替代 Windows 自带 Win+V 剪贴板历史，提供本地、轻量、稳定的剪贴板记录管理。
                        </TextBlock>
                        <Border Background="White" CornerRadius="8" Padding="16" Margin="0,0,0,8" BorderBrush="#E0E0E0" BorderThickness="1">
                            <StackPanel>
                                <TextBlock Text="核心功能" FontWeight="SemiBold" Foreground="#0078D4" Margin="0,0,0,6"/>
                                <TextBlock TextWrapping="Wrap" Foreground="#444" LineHeight="22">
                                    • 事件驱动剪贴板监听（非轮询，系统级 AddClipboardFormatListener）&#x0a;• 文本、图片（缩略图+原图）、文件路径三类历史记录&#x0a;• 按内容哈希去重（重复复制只记一条）&#x0a;• SQLite 持久化（重启后历史保留）&#x0a;• 可配置条数上限（默认 500，置顶条目不被裁剪）&#x0a;• 内容置顶（常用条目钉在列表最前）
                                </TextBlock>
                            </StackPanel>
                        </Border>
                        <Border Background="White" CornerRadius="8" Padding="16" Margin="0,0,0,8" BorderBrush="#E0E0E0" BorderThickness="1">
                            <StackPanel>
                                <TextBlock Text="交互方式" FontWeight="SemiBold" Foreground="#0078D4" Margin="0,0,0,6"/>
                                <TextBlock TextWrapping="Wrap" Foreground="#444" LineHeight="22">
                                    • 全局热键弹出悬浮历史列表（默认 Ctrl+Alt+V，光标处弹出）&#x0a;• 列表内搜索过滤（即时过滤，图片不参与搜索）&#x0a;• 键盘操作：↑↓ 选择、Enter 粘贴、Ctrl+V 纯文本粘贴、Esc 关闭&#x0a;• 粘贴时写回剪贴板并模拟 Ctrl+V 到原前台窗口&#x0a;• 系统托盘常驻（右键菜单快捷操作）
                                </TextBlock>
                            </StackPanel>
                        </Border>
                        <Border Background="White" CornerRadius="8" Padding="16" BorderBrush="#E0E0E0" BorderThickness="1">
                            <StackPanel>
                                <TextBlock Text="管理功能" FontWeight="SemiBold" Foreground="#0078D4" Margin="0,0,0,6"/>
                                <TextBlock TextWrapping="Wrap" Foreground="#444" LineHeight="22">
                                    • 主窗口全量浏览、搜索、置顶、删除、清空&#x0a;• 设置：热键改绑、条数上限、开机自启、默认纯文本粘贴&#x0a;• 单实例保护（重复启动被拒并提示）
                                </TextBlock>
                            </StackPanel>
                        </Border>
                    </StackPanel>
                </ScrollViewer>
            </TabItem>

            <!-- 快捷键 -->
            <TabItem Header="快捷键" Padding="8,4">
                <ScrollViewer VerticalScrollBarVisibility="Auto" Padding="12">
                    <StackPanel Margin="4">
                        <TextBlock Text="快捷键一览" FontSize="18" FontWeight="SemiBold" Foreground="#1A1A1A" Margin="0,0,0,12"/>
                        <Border Background="White" CornerRadius="8" Padding="16" BorderBrush="#E0E0E0" BorderThickness="1">
                            <DataGrid AutoGenerateColumns="False" IsReadOnly="True" GridLinesVisibility="None"
                                      HeadersVisibility="None" Background="Transparent" BorderThickness="0"
                                      RowBackground="Transparent" AlternatingRowBackground="#FAFAFA">
                                <DataGrid.Columns>
                                    <DataGridTextColumn Header="组合键" Binding="{Binding Key}" Width="120">
                                        <DataGridTextColumn.ElementStyle>
                                            <Style TargetType="TextBlock">
                                                <Setter Property="FontWeight" Value="SemiBold"/>
                                                <Setter Property="Foreground" Value="#1A1A1A"/>
                                                <Setter Property="FontFamily" Value="Consolas"/>
                                                <Setter Property="Margin" Value="0,6"/>
                                            </Style>
                                        </DataGridTextColumn.ElementStyle>
                                    </DataGridTextColumn>
                                    <DataGridTextColumn Header="功能" Binding="{Binding Desc}" Width="*">
                                        <DataGridTextColumn.ElementStyle>
                                            <Style TargetType="TextBlock">
                                                <Setter Property="Foreground" Value="#444"/>
                                                <Setter Property="Margin" Value="0,6"/>
                                            </Style>
                                        </DataGridTextColumn.ElementStyle>
                                    </DataGridTextColumn>
                                </DataGrid.Columns>
                            </DataGrid>
                        </Border>
                    </StackPanel>
                </ScrollViewer>
            </TabItem>

            <!-- 设置说明 -->
            <TabItem Header="设置说明" Padding="8,4">
                <ScrollViewer VerticalScrollBarVisibility="Auto" Padding="12">
                    <StackPanel Margin="4">
                        <TextBlock Text="设置项说明" FontSize="18" FontWeight="SemiBold" Foreground="#1A1A1A" Margin="0,0,0,12"/>
                        <Border Background="White" CornerRadius="8" Padding="16" BorderBrush="#E0E0E0" BorderThickness="1">
                            <StackPanel>
                                <TextBlock Text="热键设置" FontWeight="SemiBold" Foreground="#0078D4" Margin="0,0,0,4"/>
                                <TextBlock TextWrapping="Wrap" Foreground="#444" LineHeight="22">
                                    格式：修饰键+主键，如 Ctrl+Alt+V、Ctrl+Shift+V。支持 Ctrl、Alt、Shift 修饰键，主键支持 A-Z 字母、0-9 数字、F1-F24 功能键。默认 Ctrl+Alt+V。
                                </TextBlock>
                            </StackPanel>
                        </Border>
                        <Border Background="White" CornerRadius="8" Padding="16" Margin="0,8,0,0" BorderBrush="#E0E0E0" BorderThickness="1">
                            <StackPanel>
                                <TextBlock Text="历史条数上限" FontWeight="SemiBold" Foreground="#0078D4" Margin="0,0,0,4"/>
                                <TextBlock TextWrapping="Wrap" Foreground="#444" LineHeight="22">
                                    范围：10 ~ 10000。超出上限时自动裁剪最旧的非置顶条目，置顶条目永不被裁剪。默认 500。
                                </TextBlock>
                            </StackPanel>
                        </Border>
                        <Border Background="White" CornerRadius="8" Padding="16" Margin="0,8,0,0" BorderBrush="#E0E0E0" BorderThickness="1">
                            <StackPanel>
                                <TextBlock Text="开机自动启动" FontWeight="SemiBold" Foreground="#0078D4" Margin="0,0,0,4"/>
                                <TextBlock TextWrapping="Wrap" Foreground="#444" LineHeight="22">
                                    勾选后写入注册表 Run 键，开机自动启动。取消勾选自动删除注册表项。如遇安全软件拦截，请允许。
                                </TextBlock>
                            </StackPanel>
                        </Border>
                        <Border Background="White" CornerRadius="8" Padding="16" Margin="0,8,0,0" BorderBrush="#E0E0E0" BorderThickness="1">
                            <StackPanel>
                                <TextBlock Text="默认纯文本粘贴" FontWeight="SemiBold" Foreground="#0078D4" Margin="0,0,0,4"/>
                                <TextBlock TextWrapping="Wrap" Foreground="#444" LineHeight="22">
                                    开启后，粘贴时始终以纯文本格式写入剪贴板（去除来源 HTML/RTF 格式）。关闭时按原始格式粘贴（文本仍为纯文本，图片保留像素，文件保留路径）。默认关闭。
                                </TextBlock>
                            </StackPanel>
                        </Border>
                    </StackPanel>
                </ScrollViewer>
            </TabItem>

            <!-- 故障排除 -->
            <TabItem Header="故障排除" Padding="8,4">
                <ScrollViewer VerticalScrollBarVisibility="Auto" Padding="12">
                    <StackPanel Margin="4">
                        <TextBlock Text="常见问题" FontSize="18" FontWeight="SemiBold" Foreground="#1A1A1A" Margin="0,0,0,12"/>
                        <Border Background="White" CornerRadius="8" Padding="16" BorderBrush="#E0E0E0" BorderThickness="1">
                            <StackPanel>
                                <TextBlock Text="热键无响应" FontWeight="SemiBold" Foreground="#D32F2F" Margin="0,0,0,4"/>
                                <TextBlock TextWrapping="Wrap" Foreground="#444" LineHeight="22">
                                    1. 检查默认热键 Ctrl+Alt+V 是否与其他软件冲突（如 AutoHotkey、输入法快捷键）&#x0a;2. 尝试更换热键（设置 → 热键，按下新组合键后点确定）&#x0a;3. 确认程序以普通用户权限运行（非管理员也可）
                                </TextBlock>
                            </StackPanel>
                        </Border>
                        <Border Background="White" CornerRadius="8" Padding="16" Margin="0,8,0,0" BorderBrush="#E0E0E0" BorderThickness="1">
                            <StackPanel>
                                <TextBlock Text="开机自启后启动失败" FontWeight="SemiBold" Foreground="#D32F2F" Margin="0,0,0,4"/>
                                <TextBlock TextWrapping="Wrap" Foreground="#444" LineHeight="22">
                                    检查杀毒软件是否拦截（加入白名单）。exe 路径已加引号，空格不影响。如果 exe 被移动或删除，请重新设置自启。
                                </TextBlock>
                            </StackPanel>
                        </Border>
                        <Border Background="White" CornerRadius="8" Padding="16" Margin="0,8,0,0" BorderBrush="#E0E0E0" BorderThickness="1">
                            <StackPanel>
                                <TextBlock Text="剪贴板内容丢失" FontWeight="SemiBold" Foreground="#D32F2F" Margin="0,0,0,4"/>
                                <TextBlock TextWrapping="Wrap" Foreground="#444" LineHeight="22">
                                    历史记录存于 data/clipboard.db。如删除此文件会清空所有历史。请定期备份。程序崩溃时 SQLite WAL 模式可保证数据完整性（不丢未提交记录）。
                                </TextBlock>
                            </StackPanel>
                        </Border>
                        <Border Background="White" CornerRadius="8" Padding="16" Margin="0,8,0,0" BorderBrush="#E0E0E0" BorderThickness="1">
                            <StackPanel>
                                <TextBlock Text="图片显示异常" FontWeight="SemiBold" Foreground="#D32F2F" Margin="0,0,0,4"/>
                                <TextBlock TextWrapping="Wrap" Foreground="#444" LineHeight="22">
                                    确认剪贴板中为标准位图格式（截图工具如 Win+Shift+S、Snipaste 等均支持）。部分应用复制的图片格式可能不被识别。
                                </TextBlock>
                            </StackPanel>
                        </Border>
                        <Border Background="White" CornerRadius="8" Padding="16" Margin="0,8,0,0" BorderBrush="#E0E0E0" BorderThickness="1">
                            <StackPanel>
                                <TextBlock Text="数据目录" FontWeight="SemiBold" Foreground="#0078D4" Margin="0,0,0,4"/>
                                <TextBlock TextWrapping="Wrap" Foreground="#444" LineHeight="22">
                                    数据目录位于程序同级 data/ 文件夹。如需迁移：关闭程序 → 整个 data 文件夹复制到新位置 → 覆盖原 data 目录。日志无独立文件，数据库自带 WAL 日志（.db-wal / .db-shm），可安全删除。
                                </TextBlock>
                            </StackPanel>
                        </Border>
                    </StackPanel>
                </ScrollViewer>
            </TabItem>
        </TabControl>
    </Grid>
</Window>
